# The staged umbrella only, not the directory: `scripts/prune-stale-worktrees.sh`
# matches ignored paths on their final component, and a bare `Frameworks/`
# collapses the listing to a component it does not recognise (fails toward
# KEEP). `Frameworks/.gitkeep` is the tracked anchor that keeps git from that
# collapse. Mirrors the root `.gitignore`'s `Pastura/Frameworks/*.xcframework`.
Frameworks/*.xcframework
